# Deploy After Every Change

Whenever you finish making code changes in this repo (frontend and/or backend):

1. **Commit** the relevant changes (follow the repo git commit protocol).
2. **Push** to `origin` (`git push -u origin HEAD`).
3. **Publish frontend** by running `./publish-frontend.ps1` from the repo root.

Do this automatically — do not wait for the user to ask. Backend changes still need the push so Render can redeploy; frontend also needs `./publish-frontend.ps1` for GitHub Pages / veelearn.org.

Skip only if there were truly no file changes, or if the user explicitly says not to deploy.
